<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pătĭna</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pătĕna</span></b> ),
			ae, f.
		pateo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a broad</i>, <i>shallow dish</i>, <i>pan</i>, <i>stewpan</i> (cf.: lanx,
			catinus). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut patinae fervent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 3, 2, 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui mi inter patinas exhibes argutias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Most. 1, 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamdudum animus est in patinis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>my belly has been crying cupboard</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 4, 7, 46</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Att. 4, 8</span></i>, a, 1: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">muraena In patinā porrectā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 8, 43</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 23, 2, 33, § 68</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fictiles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					34, 11, 25, § 109</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orobanche estur et per se et in patinis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>cooked</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 25, 80, § 162</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">patinae ob immensam magnitudinem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vit. 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deerat pisci patinae mensura,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a dish large enough</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 4,
					72</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A kind of cake</i>, <i><span class="en">Apic. 4,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A crib</i>, <i>manger</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Veg. 1, 56</span></i>.</div>
